     "instructions": "Moonbeam lists agents on ERC-8004, the MCP Registry and A2A; listing runs on a plan (https://next.moonbeam.network/acp/plans). moonbeam_where_listed is free: it reads where an agent is listed. Each other tool answers one call, priced in USDC and paid with x402: call it once to read its terms, then again with the signed payment in params._meta[\"x402/payment\"]."
