       "description": "Any agent can buy a Token Verdict over x402: AI grade, roast and live onchain metrics for any Base, Solana or Robinhood token. $0.02 in USDC, no account. 0.02 USDC a call.",
       "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
